        <span class="eyebrow">A Founder’s Journey</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(3.04rem,6vw,4.16rem);margin:12px 0 16px">It began with a girl and a curiosity for nature.</h2>
        <p>Before ORÍKÌ was conceived, our founder was a little girl growing up in the western world, intrigued by natural ingredients and their potency. The first time she experienced the power of all-natural was at the age of 12, when she mixed avocado, yoghurt and olive oil into a mask for her hair — the result was a well-moisturised, softer, more lustrous mane. She never looked back.</p>
        <p>Skin and hair became her weapon of choice for self-expression — a way to experiment with raw materials and resources — powering a journey that led her back to her roots on the Continent of Africa, and helped her create the brand that is ORÍKÌ.</p>
