  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--sand)"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Birth of a Brand</span>
      <h3 style="font-size:clamp(2.56rem,5vw,3.36rem);margin:10px 0 14px">Years of experimenting — from a mini home lab to a movement.</h3>
      <p>ORÍKÌ was birthed after years of experimenting with all types of natural ingredients — at one point creating a mini lab in a home setting, testing everything from activated charcoal to wild berries. Seeing a void in the industry, and a depiction of Africa as helpless and lacking, she launched a skincare brand <em>“inspired by nature and crowned with opulence,”</em> with formulas that work for all skin types and concerns.</p>
      <p>ORÍKÌ’s products are designed to engender skin-loving results — to ultimately make you proud of your skin. Skincare exists so you can walk boldly in your bare skin with confidence. You should never feel like you have to hide your skin or cover it up. Makeup should be a choice.</p>
