        <span class="eyebrow">Our Name</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(3.04rem,6vw,4.16rem);margin:12px 0 16px">Your Crown, Your Inspiration.</h2>
        <p>The word ‘ORÍKÌ’ [Or.eek.e] has a rich, ancient history in Yoruba — one of the predominant languages of Nigeria. The literal translation is <em>“Your Crown / Your Origin,”</em> and an ORÍKÌ name is meant to inspire and bring out the best in an individual.</p>
        <p>Just as ORÍKÌ is a cultural expression akin to the Continent of Africa, our brand is a gateway between the best of nature and knowledge — a bridge from farm to bottle, and from botany to beauty. We love our name for its rich history, and because it’s simply beautiful. We hope you agree.</p>
