    <span class="eyebrow reveal">About ORÍKÌ</span>
    <p class="reveal" style="font-size:1.68rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px">ORÍKÌ, a Nigerian word from the Yoruba tribe meaning your crown, your heritage and your inspiration, is a product range created to make women and men <em>‘skinfident’</em> — utilizing only the best, efficient and potent natural ingredients and skin secrets from the richest resource continent in the world, Africa. ORÍKÌ Group comprises a multi-channel spa, a farm-to-skin retail product company, and a wholesale &amp; amenity product line for spas, hotels and airlines.</p>
